() '
(1. SUMMARY OF COMPLETED TASKS) '
(------------------------------------------------------------------------) '
(- App Icon: Integrated the exact user-provided image without any modifications) '
(  into icon.png, icon-512.png, icon-192.png, and icon.svg.) '
(- Splash Screen: App launch splash screen now prominently showcases the exact icon) '
(  with smooth native mobile transitions.) '
(- Tab Shift Bug Fixed: The issue where switching between Home, Learn, Review,) '
(  Quran, and Progress shifted halfway was solved by replacing lateral CSS transforms) '
(  with clean display-state toggling, eliminating all mid-transition freezing.) '
() '
(2. PEDAGOGICAL AUDIT \(LEARNING EFFECTIVENESS\)) '
(------------------------------------------------------------------------) '
(- Strengths:) '
(  * Pareto Principle: Focuses on the top 2000 Quranic lemmas covering ~80% of text.) '
(  * SM-2 Spaced Repetition System: Optimizes memory intervals based on recall speed.) '
(  * Authentic Quranic Context: Links each word directly with Quranic verses and POS tags.) '
(- Recommended Pedagogical Upgrades:) '
(  * Native Qari Audio Recitation: Add clear pronunciation for each lemma.) '
(  * Triliteral Root Visual Tree: Enable exploring word families from shared roots.) '
(  * Audio Recognition Drills: Add listening comprehension quizzes.) '
() '
