(- Badges & Gamification: Add 3D-styled Islamic geometry badges \(7-Day Streak, 500 Words Mastered\).) '
(- Quiz Interactions: Add soft haptic response, green micro-glow, and confetti particles.) '
(- Night Mode: Use deep emerald green \(#06211a\) with warm amber accents.) '
() '
(4. GOOGLE PLAY STORE LAUNCH GUIDE) '
(------------------------------------------------------------------------) '
(- Step 1: Register Google Play Console Developer Account \(5 one-time fee\).) '
